 "title": "A 50:50 mixture of N(0, 1) and N(4, 1)",
 "caption": "The mixture has two peaks. Its mean is 0.5 × 0 + 0.5 × 4 = 2, and its variance is 1 + 4 = 5: the within-component variance plus the spread of the component means.",
